ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nYue Sheng often goes to a neighbor's house of the same age to play at night when he is a child. One day, he plays until late at night, his mother comes to him before going to bed and says, \"Come to play again tomorrow.\" Yue Sheng feels invited, he doesn't really want to play with him the next day, but in order not to disappoint this kindness, he reluctantly goes to his house to play until midnight. His mother comes to him before going to bed and says, \"Come to play again tomorrow.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhat does the neighbor's mother really mean when she says this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. She hopes Yue Sheng comes to her house to play every day.\nB. She hints that Yue Sheng should leave.\nC. She really likes Yue Sheng.\nD. She thinks Yue Sheng is a friend who brings fun to her son.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004070138561537168,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52af0c2ddb05a7fe2f3dd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452208220,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:56:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6a57dfb184b54a5483a6ab0c52250572"}